ing":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nThe number of rows returned is not identical to what is returned when not using `yield_per()`. In versions older than 1.4.x, the results are correct.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe number of rows returned should always be the same.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\n```py\r\nclass Item(Base):\r\n    prid = Column(String(length=10), primary_key=True)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```py\r\nitems: Query[Item] = session.query(Item)\r\nfound = 0\r\nprint(f'{items.count()}')\r\n\r\nfor item in items.yield_per(1000):\r\n    found += 1\r\n\r\nprint(found)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Error**\r\n\r\n`found != items.count()`\r\n\r\n**Versions**\r\n - OS: Amazon Linux 2, MacOS 10.14.6 (18G8022)\r\n - Python: 3.7.10\r\n - SQLAlchemy: N/A\r\n - Database: Aurora MySQL\r\n - DBAPI: 5.7.mysql_aurora.2.07.2\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6206/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"hear